{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_8","type":"command_execution","command":"/opt/homebrew/bin/zsh -lc \"rg -n 'D73[7-9]|reader.family|family threshold' docs/DECISIONS-log.md docs/CURRENT_STATE.md AGENTS.md docs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers -g '*.md'\"","aggregated_output":"docs/CURRENT_STATE.md:448:**The one next task: read the v13s blind test's result through readers and Council B, then report to Alex (D737–D739).**\ndocs/CURRENT_STATE.md:450:- **The format shrank** (D737). Alex chose to shrink it after round 51 (D736) found the full restatement unbounded.\ndocs/CURRENT_STATE.md:451:- **What code refuses** (D738): only the five named defects, where the calculation's own structure decides them, plus broken\ndocs/CURRENT_STATE.md:453:- **The small format is built and rehearsed at $0** (D739):\ndocs/CURRENT_STATE.md:461:The record before D737 (superseded as the next task):\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:4492:  refusal; line 6 is counted by code. Lines 1, 2 and 5 depend on the reader family.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:5685:  outlook, which one reader family marks wrong and the other right, twice (kind wrong 2.6% settled, 5.1% or more by the strict reading);\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:6662:  supported\" was too strong (one reader family did not pass two of them: a maximum exposure is not the amount that will be\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:6738:  blocker. The credit-support amount is not ranked first (its fresh-week answer was unsupported for one reader family only;\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:7070:  - The first gate's instrument: one reader family holds every firm mark on 47 of 111 answer-choice lists, the other on 84;\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:8892:## D647 · 2026-11-16 · The Opus trial reads \"inconclusive\": fewer failures, one real new failure, a sharp reader-family split, astra-level cost\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:9332:     - **It does not decide** a system, assess astra's output, or change a reader family's role in a gate.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11236:## D737 · 2026-11-22 · Alex: shrink judging-v13's format to the checks that stop the named defects, then a $0 blind test\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11258:## D738 · 2026-11-22 · v13s: code refuses a named defect only where the calculation's structure decides it; readers mark the five defects on every reply (council rounds 52–53)\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11260:- **Rounds 52 and 53** (`research/2026-11-22-number-answers/codex-r52.md`, `codex-r53.md`) reviewed the small format within D737's\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11265:- **Settled (how D737's rule is built; D737 says code refuses only for the five defects, not that code catches every instance):**\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11290:## D739 · 2026-11-22 · v13s built and rehearsed; council round 54's findings fixed; the blind test runs, and its result goes to Council B\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/SMALL-DESIGN.md:1:# judging-v13 small format (v13s): code refuses only the five defects and broken structure (D737)\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/SMALL-DESIGN.md:3:Alex (D737) chose to shrink the format. Code refuses an answer only for these five defects:\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/SMALL-DESIGN.md:13:**Review scope (D737):** a counterexample that lets none of the five defects through, and breaks no structure, is a reader's matter,\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/SMALL-DESIGN.md:248:  - any of D737's five defects;\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/BLIND-RESULT.md:1:# judging-v13s blind conformance test: result (SMALL-DESIGN.md §5; D737–D739)\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/BLIND-RESULT.md:45:    estimate's `rests_on` (F8, which rests on F7), so S4's walk, which follows `inputs` only, did not see it. Under D738 this is an\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/BLIND-RESULT.md:78:- **The indirect route through an estimate's `rests_on` let one real inconsistency through.** D738 chose to record such routes for\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/round54-brief.md:3:You are an independent read-only reviewer. **Scope (Alex, D737; build rule D738):** report a finding only when it does one of these:\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/round54-brief.md:4:- (a) lets one of the five defects through **where the calculation's own structure decides it** (D738). An indirect form (a multiplier\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/round54-brief.md:13:**What was built (D738):**\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/round54-brief.md:25:**The design it implements:** `SMALL-DESIGN.md` §2 [52], §3 [52], and the D738 entry in `docs/DECISIONS-log.md`.\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/codex-r54.md:15:5. **S4 refuses two agreeing separate replies after joining them (c), (d).** I translated the stored v4 and v8 replies into v13s. Both published, and their matching Q3 and Q4 figures joined successfully. I then wrote each reply’s use of the same cited 65% Q4 growth assumption as its own forecast figure. Both replies still published individually, with the same results. After joining, S4 refused the pair because both copies of the 65% figure remained, although one was no longer used. Joining combines matching figures only for the listed shared quantities, while S4 counts every forecast, including unused ones. The request also says “compute each quantity and period once,” which is broader than D738’s restriction on forecast figures and its allowance for competing outside inputs. [answers.jsonl:4](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/poc/data/judging-v13-paid-gate-2026-11-22/answers.jsonl:4) · [paid_gate.py:376](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/paid_gate.py:376) · [calc_small.py:475](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/calc_small.py:475) · [render_v13.py:148](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/render_v13.py:148)\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/codex-r54.md:32:- **Registered cases (e).** A1 still asks for two sources for `±` guidance, while D738 and the request require one complete source. The A2 case labelled “Data Center × 1x added to company” never performs the addition. The registered case that copies `2%` out of `plus or minus 2%` is absent. The existing case changes the declared midpoint while leaving the quote intact. The assertion checks for any message with the expected rule code, while the registration calls for the intended message as well. [SMALL-DESIGN.md:173](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/SMALL-DESIGN.md:173) · [SMALL-DESIGN.md:215](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/SMALL-DESIGN.md:215) · [small_cases.py:324](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/small_cases.py:324) · [small_cases.py:382](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/small_cases.py:382) · [small_cases.py:477](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/small_cases.py:477)\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/round55-brief.md:1:# Council round 55 (Council B on the blind test's result, D739)\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/round55-brief.md:13:The design is `SMALL-DESIGN.md` (§5 registers the test and its stop conditions). The decisions are D737–D739 in\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/round55-brief.md:28:   rule on reader-family thresholds? Draft the one or two questions you would put to him, each with its concrete example and its\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/round55-brief.md:36:Scope: D737 and D738 bind. Out of scope: the frozen ruler, `poc-v118`, D725's lines, D731's harness rules. Report findings ranked by\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/round53-brief.md:3:You are an independent read-only reviewer. **The scope is binding (Alex, D737):** report a finding only when it does one of these:\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/round53-brief.md:12:D737, an estimate is recorded and shown to readers, and the readers mark the five defects on every reply.\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/round52-brief.md:5:**Alex's decision D737** (in `docs/DECISIONS-log.md`): shrink judging-v13's format.\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/round52-brief.md:15:**Review scope (binding, D737):** report a finding only when it does one of these:\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/codex-r52.md:33:- **(e) A supported forecast with a bad reference can count as usable.** Part B asks whether the forecast is supported, and the stop lines allow another reply to cover a bad one. A supported forecast whose own estimate is passed off as the reference can therefore be counted usable, or be overlooked if the other writer gets the case right. Have readers independently mark support and any of D737’s named defects on every first reply. An accepted named defect or broken structure should trigger the corresponding stop. For support, give both readers the same complete shown passages, mask writer identity and checker decisions, and require each reader to name the passage or assumption that puts the forecast in its band. Then reveal refusals for the separate wording review. Define `INCOMPLETE` against the inventory of 12 first replies and required readings, so a missing session or undecided reading cannot disappear from the count. [Reader protocol and stop lines](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/SMALL-DESIGN.md:168) · [Existing reader brief](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/reader-brief-v13.md:3)\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/codex-r53.md:1:**Not ready.** The revised rules can reject a correct sum of two Data Center quarters and accept a Data Center forecast that is larger than company revenue at every possible value. Both are within D737’s scope. A4 should be the decisive $0 check once the written rules and their test cases agree.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
